    head-to-head vs the 6-10 book (#135): #1 beat it in 15/37 (41%), the 2-5 book did in 13/37 (35%) — denominator 37 here vs 37 for the 11-20 line above
  after-tax (28% PT, top-10 book): never-sell +6.2%/yr vs yearly-rotation +5.6%/yr -> deferral edge +0.6 pts/yr
  (BOOK = equal-weight terminal wealth annualized (winners carry it, a zero costs its 1/N weight); >0 beats S&P500.
   NON-stress: picks are today's survivors (biased UP) vs the true index — run `stress` for the honest excess.)

